<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Step2Fix - Instant No-BS Tech Solutions</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; }
    body { background-color: #0b1120; color: #f8fafc; padding: 15px; }
    .container { max-width: 760px; margin: 30px auto; background: #1e293b; padding: 25px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #334155; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.6); }
    
    header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 25px; }
    h1 { font-size: 26px; color: #38bdf8; letter-spacing: -0.5px; }
    p.tagline { color: #94a3b8; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 5px; }

    .search-wrapper { margin-bottom: 20px; }
    #searchBar { width: 100%; padding: 14px 18px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #475569; background: #0f172a; color: #fff; font-size: 15px; outline: none; transition: 0.2s; }
    #searchBar:focus { border-color: #38bdf8; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3); }

    .category-pills { display: flex; gap: 8px; overflow-x: auto; padding-bottom: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; }
    .pill { background: #334155; color: #cbd5e1; padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 12px; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; border: none; transition: 0.2s; }
    .pill:hover, .pill.active { background: #38bdf8; color: #0b1120; font-weight: bold; }

    .ad-banner { background: #172033; border: 1px dashed #475569; border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 20px; }

    .error-card { background: #0f172a; border: 1px solid #334155; border-radius: 8px; padding: 18px; margin-bottom: 16px; transition: transform 0.15s ease; }
    .card-meta { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .platform-badge { font-size: 11px; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .badge-android { background: #065f46; color: #34d399; }
    .badge-windows { background: #1e40af; color: #60a5fa; }
    .badge-gaming { background: #831843; color: #f472b6; }
    
    .card-title { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: #f1f5f9; margin-bottom: 12px; line-height: 1.4; }
    
    .steps-list { list-style: none; counter-reset: step-idx; }
    .steps-list li { position: relative; padding-left: 28px; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 13.5px; color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.5; }
    .steps-list li::before { content: counter(step-idx); counter-increment: step-idx; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; background: #38bdf8; color: #0b1120; width: 19px; height: 19px; border-radius: 50%; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; line-height: 19px; }

    .monetize-strip { margin-top: 14px; padding: 8px 12px; background: #1e293b; border-left: 3px solid #10b981; border-radius: 4px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; font-size: 12px; }
    .monetize-strip a { color: #34d399; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; }
    .monetize-strip a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

    .empty-state { text-align: center; color: #64748b; padding: 30px; display: none; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
  <header>
    <h1>Step2Fix</h1>
    <p class="tagline">No 10-minute intros. Exact 2-step verified fixes.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="search-wrapper">
    <input type="text" id="searchBar" placeholder="Search error (e.g., download failed, 0x800, mic lag, 5G drop)...">
  </div>

  <div class="category-pills">
    <button class="pill active" onclick="filterCategory('All')">All</button>
    <button class="pill" onclick="filterCategory('Android')">Android</button>
    <button class="pill" onclick="filterCategory('Gaming')">Gaming</button>
    <button class="pill" onclick="filterCategory('Windows')">Windows PC</button>
  </div>

  <div class="ad-banner">Top Responsive Ad Slot (AdSense / Monetag Auto Unit)</div>

  <div id="cardsList"></div>
  <div id="emptyState" class="empty-state">No matching fix found. Try another error code or term.</div>
</div>

<script>
// Verified High-Volume Issue Database
